                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Acceptance Criteria:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_10320-3671457-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      <p>Feature: Feature flags for module release with a removal date</p>

<p>  Background:<br/>
    Given flag "rwb.casewf.case-list-queue-column" exists with default off, owner team "P3 squad" and removal date 2027-01-31</p>

<p>  Scenario: AC1 Flag off by default<br/>
    Given the flag has no value set for UAT<br/>
    When the case list service starts in UAT<br/>
    Then FeatureFlags.isOn("rwb.casewf.case-list-queue-column") returns false<br/>
    Then the system hides the queue column on SCR-02 Case list</p>

<p>  Scenario: AC2 Flag switched on<br/>
    Given a platform administrator sets the flag to on in UAT with reason "UAT test of queue column" at 10:15<br/>
    When the case list page is reloaded at 10:16<br/>
    Then the queue column shows without a deployment<br/>
    Then a change row holds environment "UAT", old value off, new value on, the user and the time 10:15<br/>
    Then the ACE audit log holds the same change</p>

<p>  Scenario: AC3 Flag expiry<br/>
    Given flag "rwb.p5.ocr-intake" has removal date 2026-11-30 and owner team "P5 squad"<br/>
    Given today is Monday 2026-12-07<br/>
    When the weekly flag report runs at 08:00<br/>
    Then the system lists the flag for removal with its owner and 7 days past its removal date<br/>
    Then the report carries message MSG-P2-003 for the flag<br/>
    Then the system does not list flag "rwb.casewf.case-list-queue-column" with removal date 2027-01-31</p>

<p>  Scenario: AC4 Removal date checked at creation<br/>
    Given today is 2026-11-16<br/>
    When a platform administrator creates flag "rwb.p6.line-dispatch" with removal date 2026-11-10<br/>
    Then the system does not creat the flag<br/>
    Then the response is 422 with message MSG-GEN-003<br/>
    Then a creation with no removal date returns 422 with message MSG-GEN-001</p>

<p>  Scenario: AC5 Change without a reason refused<br/>
    When a platform administrator sets the flag to on in SIT with an empty reason<br/>
    Then the response is 422 with message MSG-GEN-001<br/>
    Then the flag stays off in SIT</p>

<p>  Scenario: AC6 Unknown key in code<br/>
    When code calls FeatureFlags.isOn("rwb.casewf.not-defined")<br/>
    Then the result is false<br/>
    Then a warning with the key and no user data is written to the application log</p>

<p>  Scenario: AC7 Flag store unavailable<br/>
    Given the flag is on in UAT and the cache holds the value from 10:20<br/>
    When the flag table cannot be read at 10:21<br/>
    Then FeatureFlags.isOn returns true from the cache<br/>
    Then after a restart with the table still unavailable it returns false</p>

<p>  Scenario: AC8 Two changes at once<br/>
    Given two platform administrators read the flag at version 4<br/>
    When both send a change with If-Match version 4<br/>
    Then the system saves one change with version 5<br/>
    Then the system refuses the other with 409 and message MSG-GEN-004</p>

<p>  Scenario: AC9 Change to a key that does not exist<br/>
    When a platform administrator sends a change for flag "rwb.p9.unknown"<br/>
    Then the response is 404 with message MSG-P2-016</p>
  </td>
            </tr>
                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Team:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_10001-3671457-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%"><div class="shorten" id="customfield_10001-field">
    <span></span>
</div>
</td>
